  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{習|なら}う (learn X) / X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{習|なら}う (learn from X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing action. {習|なら}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is learning/taking lessons.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{日本語|にほんご}→日本語：00614_nihongo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{習|なら}う (learn Japanese)\n- ⟦ピアノ→ピアノ：01376_piano⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{習|なら}う (learn piano)\n- ⟦{先生|せんせい}→先生：00609_sensei⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{習|なら}う (learn from teacher)\n- ⟦{習|なら}い{事|ごと}→習い事：13902_naraigoto⟧ (lessons/extracurricular activities)\n\nCounterpart: ⟦{教|おし}える→教える：00526_oshieru⟧ (to teach). Emphasizes learning from someone.",
